    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Control WooCommerce price visibility using flexible rules.</p>\n<h3>Short Description</h3>\n<p>Hide WooCommerce product prices and add-to-cart buttons using flexible, rule-based conditions.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Hide prices for guests, logged-in users, or specific roles</li>\n<li>Target products or categories</li>\n<li>Replace price text</li>\n<li>Hide Add to Cart button</li>\n<li>Server-side enforcement</li>\n<li>WooCommerce REST API safe</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin</li>\n<li>Activate</li>\n<li>Go to WooCommerce <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Hide Price</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20work%20with%20variable%20products%3F\">\nDoes this work with variable products?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20hide%20prices%20in%20the%20rest%20api%3F\">\nDoes this hide prices in the REST API?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, prices are hidden in WooCommerce REST and Store APIs.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
